<title>UK: GZB sets 200 million mark seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>GZB sets 200 million mark seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENOSSENSCHAFTLICHE ZENTRALBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    23.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    23.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.885    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTTGART DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
